WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
I mean, you can ignore it, but that's your side, my friend.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.400
Like I said, you were the one that

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.800
tried to derail this argument by bringing that.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.040
It's just because of my argument.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.600
I'm saying immigrants are good to America.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.840
People on your side are saying, we should leave.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.640
Not me, me and you.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.080
And I asked you, what type of immigrants

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.000
are we talking about?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.960
Immigrants overall.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.459
Overall.

00:00:16.459 --> 00:00:17.240
Overall.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:25.440
So you believe that people that come here without any respect

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.480
to our laws and our borders are going

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.639
to be good for this country.

00:00:29.639 --> 00:00:31.080
No, of course not.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.160
So you can't say that all immigrants overall.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.320
I never said all immigrants.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.639
I said immigrants overall.

00:00:35.639 --> 00:00:37.799
Immigrants overall doesn't mean all immigrants.

00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:38.919
Sorry to break that to you.

00:00:38.919 --> 00:00:40.680
All right, so we have to make sure

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.160
that the people are coming here have the good intent

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.279
of this country in mind.

00:00:44.279 --> 00:00:44.779
Agreed?

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:45.279
Yes.

00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:46.240
Irrelevant to my claim, but agreed.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.560
But when you have undocumented immigration going on,

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:49.520
you can't vet that.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.959
You can't make sure about that.

00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:53.840
Let me, real quick, talk about my background.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.320
There is no American embassy in Iran.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.119
So in order to come here, you have

00:00:58.119 --> 00:01:00.360
to stay in line for four years, and you

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.720
have to go through some serious vetting procedure to get here.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:04.559
But I made it.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:06.760
And that process has to be in place,

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.480
because you don't want terrorists to fill this country.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.080
I made it, too.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:10.839
I'm an American citizen.

00:01:10.839 --> 00:01:11.639
I went through lots of vetting.

00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:12.400
I took my test.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.080
And that's how it should be.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.360
But the guy over there wants us to leave.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:14.559
But?

00:01:14.559 --> 00:01:15.040
But.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:15.760
But he wants us to leave.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:16.239
When people.

00:01:16.239 --> 00:01:17.599
So people don't really care about vetting, do they?

00:01:17.599 --> 00:01:19.000
It's not really about vetting, is it, my friend?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.040
But people should not have the right.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:20.760
You're in denial.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.080
People should not have the right to ignore

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.279
our borders and our laws.

00:01:24.279 --> 00:01:26.080
What about those of you who don't ignore the borders?

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.279
Should we get to stay?

00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:27.800
Of course.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:28.760
But he says we shouldn't.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:29.400
Vaughn.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.440
I'm not debating him.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:32.919
You kind of are, because you're all together on this.

00:01:32.919 --> 00:01:33.839
No, I'm debating you.

00:01:33.839 --> 00:01:34.519
OK.

00:01:34.519 --> 00:01:37.160
And I'm pointing out to you that your argument is in bad faith,

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.239
because these guys are actually speaking the truth,

00:01:39.239 --> 00:01:41.400
and you're in denial about who's on your side.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.680
He wants you gone.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.639
I never claim that I'm on their side or they're on my side.

00:01:45.639 --> 00:01:46.639
I'm here to debate you.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:47.639
All right, pause.

00:01:47.639 --> 00:01:49.239
You've been voted out by the majority.

00:01:49.239 --> 00:01:50.040
Please return to your seat.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:50.720
Nice to meet you.

